From osklyar at ebi.ac.uk  Fri Aug  3 15:18:52 2007
From: osklyar at ebi.ac.uk (Oleg Sklyar)
Date: Fri, 03 Aug 2007 14:18:52 +0100
Subject: [BioC] How to sort a matrix based on its column names
