Hi Matt,

To access the data in a flowFrame object you have to use the exprs() 
function:
exprs(fs[[1]])[,1]
or
exprs(fs[[1]])[,"FSC.H"]

This method is explained in the vignette but it is true that no example 
is given. We will fix that.

Thanks
Nolwenn

