If I am correctly understanding the problem, I think that this is what
you want:

set.seed(1)

# Create a 3x3x3 array
ARR <- array(sample(100, 27), c(3, 3, 3))

> ARR
, , 1

     [,1] [,2] [,3]
[1,]   27   89   97
[2,]   37   20   62
[3,]   57   86   58

, , 2

     [,1] [,2] [,3]
[1,]    6   61   43
[2,]   19   34   88
